# Canonical Link headers — one per route.
# Cloudflare Pages applies these headers based on the requested URL path,
# before the _redirects rewrite serves index.html. Search engines (Google,
# Bing) and Ahrefs all support canonical via HTTP Link header.
# Add a new entry whenever a new journal post or case study is published.

